{number: 158}
{title: Freely, Freely}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] God forgave my sin in Jesus' [F] name,
I've been [C] born again in Jesus' [G7] name;
And in [C] Jesus' name I come to [F] you
To [C] share His [G7] love as He told me [C] to.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
He said, [C] "Freely, freely you have re-[F] ceived,
[C] Freely, freely [G7] give;
Go in My [C] name, and because you be-[F] lieve,
[C] Others will [G7] know that I [C] live."
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
All [C] pow'r is giv'n in Jesus' [F] name,
In earth [C] and heav'n in Jesus' [G7] name;
And in [C] Jesus' name I come to [F] you
To [C] share His [G7] pow'r as He told me [C] to.
{end_of_verse}
